swagger-parser 2.1.48 (https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-parser), Copyright SmartBear Software, Apache-2.0.
  The root crate and crates/safe-url-resolver port its modules and its tests. upstream/ is the original source at the
  ported release, a git submodule, unmodified, with its own LICENSE.

swagger-core 2.2.53 (https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-core), Copyright SmartBear Software, Apache-2.0.
  src/models ports its OpenAPI v3 models, and the JSON and YAML printers.

swagger-parser 1.0.76, swagger-core 1.6.16 and swagger-models 1.6.16, Copyright SmartBear Software, Apache-2.0.
  src/v2 and src/compat port the Swagger 2.0 stack that swagger-parser's converter uses.

Jackson 2.22 (https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson), Copyright FasterXML, LLC, Apache-2.0.
  crates/jackson reproduces the behaviour of jackson-core, jackson-databind and jackson-dataformat-yaml that
  swagger-parser relies on, as recorded from the real library (reference/).

SnakeYAML 2.6 (https://bitbucket.org/snakeyaml/snakeyaml), Copyright the SnakeYAML authors, Apache-2.0.
  crates/snakeyaml ports its loader, resolver, SafeConstructor and emitter.

